<view class="page apply-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">A FRIEND SENT YOU AN INVITE</view><view class="title">有人想和你保持联系</view>
  <view class="card error-card" wx:if="{{error}}"><view class="error-title">邀请暂时打不开</view><view class="subtitle">{{error}}</view></view>
  <view class="card invite-preview" wx:elif="{{circle}}"><view class="preview-mark">{{circle.type === 'family' ? '家' : '同'}}</view><view class="preview-name">{{circle.name}}</view><view class="pill {{circle.type === 'family' ? '' : 'class-pill'}}">{{circle.type === 'family' ? '家庭圈' : '同学圈'}}</view><view class="small muted class-meta" wx:if="{{circle.type === 'classmate'}}">{{circle.school}} · {{circle.cohort}} · {{circle.className}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="small muted">有效期至 {{expiryText}}。申请通过前看不到圈内资料。</view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{status && status !== 'active'}}" class="card status-card"><view class="status-title">{{status === 'expired' ? '邀请已过期' : status === 'revoked' ? '邀请已撤销' : '邀请已使用'}}</view><view class="subtitle">请联系邀请人，让管理员重新生成一份邀请。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{submitted}}" class="card status-card"><view class="success-icon">✓</view><view class="status-title">申请已送出</view><view class="subtitle">管理员核对后才能进入圈子。演示模式可返回管理页批准这份申请。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{status === 'active'}}" class="card apply-form"><view class="section-title">申请加入</view><label class="field"><text class="field-label">你的姓名 *</text><input class="field-control" value="{{name}}" placeholder="管理员认识你的名字" maxlength="30" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" /></label><label class="field"><text class="field-label">给管理员的身份说明</text><textarea class="field-control textarea" value="{{note}}" placeholder="例如：我是高三二班的王宁；如需认领现有人物卡，也请在这里说明。" maxlength="120" data-field="note" bindinput="onInput" /></label><button class="btn" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">{{submitting ? '正在提交…' : '提交加入申请'}}</button><view class="small muted privacy-note">提交申请不代表自动加入。管理员核对后才会开放圈内资料。</view></view>
</view>
